N5008 [over.match.funcs.general]/4: with `using base::f;', d.f(1) chose
between base::f(int) and derived::f(double) with a derived-to-base
conversion of d for the former and was reported as ambiguous.
[namespace.udecl]/14: a redeclaration in the class hides the member the
using-declaration brings in.
